WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.380
Is a half just any piece?

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:03.620
No.

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:06.410
A half is one of two equal parts.

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:08.980
Unequal pieces aren't halves.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:14.016
Cut a bar into 2 equal pieces. Each one is a half.
